usage: tb_launch_after_adoption_v3.py [-h] --new-cid NEW_CID --adoption-result
                                      ADOPTION_RESULT --adoption-result-sha256
                                      ADOPTION_RESULT_SHA256 --events-before
                                      EVENTS_BEFORE --events-before-sha256
                                      EVENTS_BEFORE_SHA256 --output OUTPUT

Prepared separate service launch; run only after actual default adoption. This
records a live TensorBoard child, not its future exit status. The host
operator separately verifies the new CID, host listener, HTTP and event SHA.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --new-cid NEW_CID
  --adoption-result ADOPTION_RESULT
  --adoption-result-sha256 ADOPTION_RESULT_SHA256
  --events-before EVENTS_BEFORE
  --events-before-sha256 EVENTS_BEFORE_SHA256
  --output OUTPUT
